<title>BELGIUM: SGB sees higher 1997 earnings.</title>
<headline>SGB sees higher 1997 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company SGB repeated in a statement at the annual meeting on Wednesday that both the consolidated net current result and the net profit would continue to grow in 1997.  </p>
<p>The company said in March its group net profit excluding minorities in calendar 1996 rose to 11.22 billion francs from 9.21 billion the previous year.</p>
<p>Consolidated current net profit rose to 11.09 billion francs from 9.98 billion.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
